{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cluster_security", "label": "Cluster-Sicherheit", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Der Cluster-Transport ist standardmaessig unauthentifiziertes Plain-TCP \u2014 in Ordnung in einem privaten Netz, nicht ausserhalb; TLS ist alles-oder-nichts pro Cluster, gemischtes Plain plus TLS funktioniert nicht.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_mutual_tls", "label": "Mutual TLS", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "rejectUnauthorized: true plus eine gemeinsame CA verlangt von beiden Seiten ein gueltiges Cert \u2014 keine anonymen Joins, kein Plain-Text-Fallback.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_tcptransport", "label": "TcpTransport (TLS-Konfiguration)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cert_layout", "label": "Cert-Layout", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Minimum ist ein CA-Cert plus Schluessel und ein von der CA signiertes Per-Node-Cert; jeder Node laedt sein eigenes Cert und die CA, um Peers zu verifizieren.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cert_manager", "label": "cert-manager und Secrets", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "cert-manager erneuert Certs automatisch, Pods laden sie beim Neustart neu \u2014 Rotation ohne Downtime heisst Rolling Restart, sobald neue Certs bereitliegen.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_networkpolicy", "label": "NetworkPolicy als zweite Schicht", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Nur Pods mit dem passenden Label erreichen den Cluster-Port; kombiniert mit mTLS sind das zwei unabhaengige Schichten.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_rejectunauthorized_false", "label": "rejectUnauthorized: false", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Hebelt die Authentifizierung aus und akzeptiert jedes Cert \u2014 nie in Produktion.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_threat_model", "label": "Bedrohungen und Massnahmen", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Lauschangriff und MITM decken TLS und Zertifikatspruefung ab, unautorisierten Join nur mTLS, ein kompromittiertes Cert nur Rotation und Revocation, und Replay eines Gossip-Frames zusaetzlich die Sequence pro Sender.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_tls_overhead", "label": "TLS-Performance-Auswirkung", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Rund 5-15 Prozent Overhead pro Byte \u2014 bei typischen Actor-Nachrichten unbemerkbar, bei hochfrequentem Cluster-Verkehr messbar, aber selten der Flaschenhals.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cluster_security", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_mutual_tls", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_mutual_tls", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cert_layout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cert_manager", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cert_layout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_networkpolicy", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_mutual_tls", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_rejectunauthorized_false", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_mutual_tls", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_threat_model", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cluster_security", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_tls_overhead", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cluster_security", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_tcptransport", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cluster_security", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_cluster_security", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_transports_transport", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_security_threat_model", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_cluster_client_not_client_authentication", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/cluster-security.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}